menu "Swarm satellite configuration"

    config SWARM_NODE_ID
        int "TDMA node_id (1-9 assigned satellite slots; 15 = unprovisioned)"
        range 1 15
        default 15
        help
            Per-unit provisioning (ADR 0027). 15 is the unprovisioned
            sentinel: the TDMA task refuses to transmit at node_id 15,
            mechanically enforcing protocols/specs/messages.md's node_id
            allocation table ("a 15 on air is a provisioning bug"). Flash
            each satellite with its own value.

    config SWARM_I2C_FREQ_HZ
        int "I2C bus clock (Hz)"
        default 50000
        help
            One bus carries the PMU (0x34), SCD30 (0x61) and BME688 (0x76).
            Sensirion's SCD30 interface description (sec 1.1) recommends
            <= 50 kHz even though the part's own spec allows up to 100 kHz.

endmenu
